{"recordId":"emperor_陳頊","name":"陳頊","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"陳宣帝","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"陈宣帝","pageId":111978,"revisionId":93506960,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-07-16T17:32:07Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%99%88%E5%AE%A3%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93506960","wikidataId":"Q718227","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"新唐书·宰相世系表","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"大唐故光禄大夫上柱国吴兴郡公赠礼部尚书荆州都督定公夫人陈氏之志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"嘉泰吳興志 卷十六","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"嘉泰吳興志","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"隋书 卷五十二 列传十七","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:35:03.210Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:suishu"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:suishu-03cb5bfff7dc6bc3","query":"陳頊","count":1,"offset":4878,"excerpt":"莫向。分閫推轂，嘗不踰時，風馳席卷，一舉大定，擒斬兇惡，掃地無遺。此又公之功也。陳頊因循偽業，自擅金陵，屢遣醜徒，趑趄江北。公指麾藩鎮，無不摧殄。方置文深之柱，〔文深之柱　「深」應作「淵」，唐人諱改。馬援字文淵，立銅柱事見後漢書本傳。〕非止尉佗","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:suishu-cd6ec3ac6127a465","query":"陳頊","count":2,"offset":189,"excerpt":"\n:昔有苗不賓，唐堯薄伐，孫皓僭虐，晉武行誅。有陳竊據江表，逆天暴物。朕初受命，陳頊尚存，思欲教之以道，不以龔行為令，往來修睦，望其遷善。時日無幾，釁惡已聞。厚納叛亡，侵犯城戍，勾吳、閩越，肆厥殘忍。于時王師大舉，將一車書，陳頊反地收兵，深懷震","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":2,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:suishu-03cb5bfff7dc6bc3","bookId":"book:suishu","requestedTitle":"隋書/卷01","title":"隋書/卷01","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B701","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=8230488","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B701?action=history","revisionId":8230488,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-08-12T03:25:16Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:49:02.320Z","sha256":"3973dbec874bd2a2ea0a25e1f3425236778af3a9d848cf9839382f0a5d64cffb","textSha256":"5e8ed7382174c050e420ea3ac2d749781b49e85c48b7f5510a975cc3be63518f","expandedWikitextSha256":"3973dbec874bd2a2ea0a25e1f3425236778af3a9d848cf9839382f0a5d64cffb","characters":13569,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/suishu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.670Z","upstreamTextQuality":null,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":[],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/b1d7b7d7681b19ce162d.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/b1d7b7d7681b19ce162d.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:suishu-cd6ec3ac6127a465","bookId":"book:suishu","requestedTitle":"隋書/卷02","title":"隋書/卷02","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2312454","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E9%9A%8B%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B702?action=his